  "title": "Texas Guard engineers, drone teams and Czech firefighters search flood-affected terrain near Kerrville, TX",
  "description": "U.S. Soldiers and Airmen with the Texas Army National Guard’s 454th Engineer Company and 640th Small Unmanned Aerial Systems Detachment, Delta Flight, partner with Czech firefighters and Missouri Task Force 1 responders to conduct search operations near the Guadalupe River in Kerrville, Texas, July 15, 2025. The combined teams used drone reconnaissance, search dogs and engineer support to cover rugged terrain and assist local authorities in locating missing persons following historic flooding. The Czech team deployed under the Texas–Czechia State Partnership Program. (U.S. Army video by Sgt. 1st Class Christy L. Sherman)",
